which is the idea that at some point, machines will become conscious and sentient. And very often, it's in the context of, the machines will rise up and harm the humans and destroy us. But as I read your research, I actually found myself thinking, is our desire to believe that the machines can become conscious, actually just an extension of what we've been talking about the last 20 minutes, which is we project sentience onto machines all the time.
也就是在某个时刻，机器将变得有意识和有感知力。而且往往是在这样的语境下：机器将崛起并伤害人类，摧毁我们。但当我阅读你的研究时，我发现自己在想：我们渴望相信机器能够变得有意识，其实真的只是我们过去20分钟一直在讨论的内容的延伸吗？也就是说，我们一直在把感知力投射到机器身上。

